#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, DeepSkyButton)
#: tools/obslistwizard.ui:157
msgid "Deep sky"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, SolarSystemButton)
